  title: A  L I F E
  button: A LIFE
  subtitle: BALL / BOOK / SKATEBOARD / LAPTOP / MOUSE / UMBRELLA
  intro: Six things from one life. Turn them in the light until their shadows stand
    up as one person.
  hint: Start with the head. The umbrella becomes something to lean on. Seen from
    the side, an open laptop bends like an elbow.
  complete: 'A LIFE

    The ball he chased, the books he carried, the board he rode,
    the work he did -

    all of it, still holding him up.'
  accent: {r: 0.94, g: 0.7, b: 0.39, a: 1}
